    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0175","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Vũ Ulloa talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. The artist asked that the microphone face away from the painting, so as not to influence it.</Description>
